			"notes": "This release finishes (NOT POLISHES) the logic the kiln multi-block, as well as adding the following changes:\nIt is probably unstable cuz the logic has not been tested very harshly yet, please report issues!\n\n# Added\n- Restructured/Refactored the java classes\n- Adding a tab to the creative inventory\n- Added hard clay ball, used to craft the kiln block set\n- Added wooden/metal tongs, used to move the crucible\n- Added copper tool heads\n- Added logic to get to copper tools completely in survival\n- Added several (temporary) advancements to guide the player\n- Added recipes/loot-tables to kiln block set (forget kiln fire loot table...), firestarter, tongs, and hopefully everything that was missing one\n# Fixed/Changed\n- Fixed the kiln slab model not working\n- Fixed the crucible not storing items after re-log"
		},
